    "name": "Grand Mountain Adventure 2",
    "steam_appid": 3605330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your skis (or snowboard) and enjoy a day in the mountains! Compete in challenges, try activities like paragliding, ziplining, and speed skiing, or relax and carve your own path down the mountain. The choice is yours in this snowy open-world adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605330/extras/95cab67353da092e2af200118beff5aa.poster.avif?t=1755595150\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605330/extras/95cab67353da092e2af200118beff5aa.webm?t=1755595150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605330/extras/95cab67353da092e2af200118beff5aa.mp4?t=1755595150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUGE OPEN-WORLD SKI RESORTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore massive ski resorts with busy slopes, deep forests, steep cliffs, untouched backcountry, and lively Apr\u00e8s Skis. Ride the lifts, explore the pistes, or head off-piste to discover secret spots. The mountains are non-linear, giving you the freedom to explore anywhere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUNDREDS OF UNIQUE CHALLENGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in a wide range of challenges like slalom, big air, slopestyle, downhill racing, and ski jumping. The challenges are easy to learn but hard to master, with an extreme Double-Diamond difficulty for the daring.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPECIAL ACTIVITIES AND MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From paragliding and ziplining to longboarding and speedskiing, the mountain is packed with extra activities and special modes like 2D platformer, and top-down skiing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605330/extras/330cc69a0d19e99241cba001479a71d5.poster.avif?t=1755595150\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605330/extras/330cc69a0d19e99241cba001479a71d5.webm?t=1755595150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605330/extras/330cc69a0d19e99241cba001479a71d5.mp4?t=1755595150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GEAR AND CLOTHES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new gear and clothing and customize your look. And unlock unique clothing by completing difficult challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRICKS, COMBOS AND TRANSITIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine spins, flips, rodeos, grabs, boxes, rails, and transitions for impressive trick combos. Master advanced moves like nose/tail presses or tapping trees with your ski tip for epic multipliers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REALISTIC MOUNTAIN SIMULATOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather, skiers that ski around on their own, changing mountain conditions, and elements like wind, snowfall, day-night cycles, avalanches, and rolling rocks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ZEN MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn on Zen Mode to enjoy a distraction-free powder day. No pesky lift-queues, busy slopes\u00a0 or challenges to interrupt your flow. Get a whole ski resort for yourself!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTUITIVE CONTROLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, intuitive controls and game controller support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About Toppluva</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Grand Mountain Adventure 2 is made by three snowboarding brothers from Sweden: Viktor, Sebastian, and Alexander. This is our second game in the popular Grand Mountain Adventure series, played by over 20 million players worldwide. We make everything in the game ourselves and our goal is to make this sequel bigger, better, stronger, more fun, more magical, and more everything for winter sports fans like us.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your skis (or snowboard) and enjoy a day in the mountains! Compete in challenges, try activities like paragliding, ziplining, and speed skiing, or relax and carve your own path down the mountain. The choice is yours in this snowy open-world adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605330/extras/95cab67353da092e2af200118beff5aa.poster.avif?t=1755595150\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605330/extras/95cab67353da092e2af200118beff5aa.webm?t=1755595150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605330/extras/95cab67353da092e2af200118beff5aa.mp4?t=1755595150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUGE OPEN-WORLD SKI RESORTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore massive ski resorts with busy slopes, deep forests, steep cliffs, untouched backcountry, and lively Apr\u00e8s Skis. Ride the lifts, explore the pistes, or head off-piste to discover secret spots. The mountains are non-linear, giving you the freedom to explore anywhere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HUNDREDS OF UNIQUE CHALLENGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in a wide range of challenges like slalom, big air, slopestyle, downhill racing, and ski jumping. The challenges are easy to learn but hard to master, with an extreme Double-Diamond difficulty for the daring.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SPECIAL ACTIVITIES AND MODES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From paragliding and ziplining to longboarding and speedskiing, the mountain is packed with extra activities and special modes like 2D platformer, and top-down skiing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605330/extras/330cc69a0d19e99241cba001479a71d5.poster.avif?t=1755595150\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605330/extras/330cc69a0d19e99241cba001479a71d5.webm?t=1755595150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605330/extras/330cc69a0d19e99241cba001479a71d5.mp4?t=1755595150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GEAR AND CLOTHES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase new gear and clothing and customize your look. And unlock unique clothing by completing difficult challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRICKS, COMBOS AND TRANSITIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine spins, flips, rodeos, grabs, boxes, rails, and transitions for impressive trick combos. Master advanced moves like nose/tail presses or tapping trees with your ski tip for epic multipliers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REALISTIC MOUNTAIN SIMULATOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather, skiers that ski around on their own, changing mountain conditions, and elements like wind, snowfall, day-night cycles, avalanches, and rolling rocks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ZEN MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn on Zen Mode to enjoy a distraction-free powder day. No pesky lift-queues, busy slopes\u00a0 or challenges to interrupt your flow. Get a whole ski resort for yourself!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTUITIVE CONTROLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, intuitive controls and game controller support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About Toppluva</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Grand Mountain Adventure 2 is made by three snowboarding brothers from Sweden: Viktor, Sebastian, and Alexander. This is our second game in the popular Grand Mountain Adventure series, played by over 20 million players worldwide. We make everything in the game ourselves and our goal is to make this sequel bigger, better, stronger, more fun, more magical, and more everything for winter sports fans like us.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Grab your skis or snowboard and explore massive open-world resorts. Ride at your own pace, take on slalom, slopestyle, and downhill challenges, or try out activities like paragliding, ziplining, wakeboarding, and longboarding. Carve your own path!",
